COMPILATION OF: E51L

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E51L

   1 a 0000 E51L:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-51/P1] CONSTANT-DIVISOR CONTROL: z = a / 3.  [C089]/P080A
   4 a 0006      already pin DR and my byte-exact lowering (LHLD a / MVI A,03 /
   5 a 0006      PUSH H / MOV L,A / ADD A / SBB A / MOV H,A / POP D / CALL
   6 a 0006      ?ID22N / SHLD z).  This row rides the SAME oracle batch as the
   7 a 0006      bank harness control: DR must accept and MINE must already be
   8 a 0006      byte-exact whole-file against the new E51L golden; any miss
   9 a 0006      means the batch or my constant path drifted, and every other
  10 a 0006      row must then be re-read with suspicion. */
  11 c 0006   dcl a fixed, b fixed, c fixed, z fixed;
  12 c 0006   z = a / 3;
  13 a 0017 end E51L;

CODE SIZE = 001A
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 38B1
END  COMPILATION
